  "(weight {0}, threshold {1}): {2}./Follows \"not inlined - too costly\". {0} is the inline weight LLVM computed for the call and {1} the budget it had to stay under.{2} is an already-formatted list such as \"Instructions: 240, Argument setup: 14\".Both numbers are plain integers with no unit.": "(peso {0}, soglia {1}): {2}.",
  "(weight {0}, threshold {1})./Follows \"not inlined - too costly\". {0} is the inline weight LLVM computed for the call and {1} the budget it had to stay under.Both are plain integers with no unit.": "(peso {0}, soglia {1}).",
  "{0} {1}/{0} is a verdict such as \"inlined\", {1} its detail such as \"(weight 35, threshold 250)\".": "{0} {1}",
