  "- Inline weight: {0} to {1}/A range of inline cost estimates across call sites; both arrive formatted, e.g. \"1690 (~338 instructions)\".Markdown list item - keep the leading \"- \", it is what makes the list render.": "- Peso inline: da {0} a {1}",
